{"id":"vod_sn_38041","vodId":"38041","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"学园孤岛","name_cn":"学园孤岛","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/90b652f31fcce7a032d848d133dc8fe0.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在巡之丘学园中，丈枪由纪（水濑祈 配音）天真可爱，是名副其实的开心果。惠飞须泽胡桃（小泽亚李 配音）踏实可靠，她的坚强和元气影响了身边的每一个人。若狭悠里（市道真央 配音）温柔坚强，是大家心目中稳重的靠山。直树美纪（高桥李依 配音）外表冷漠，但内心的热情不容忽视。这些可爱的孩子们共同组成了“学园生活部”，每天都在进行愉快的部活。　　空无一人的校园，破败不堪的教室，四处游走的行尸，究竟哪一个是幻想，哪一个是真实？巨大的灾难面前，少女们将恐惧化作力量，尽各自的所能，目的只有一个，那就是活得更久，更快乐。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:57:49","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/nzDH1M7ZKk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fpf0FBXaq21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3CKVMKTEcn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/DSP4YQpdt31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/0zSdL9jS8Z1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/m1BMEqZciz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/RVsc5QZc4R1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JPDJNrTygA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/T0ZbghMb821/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/KSb9am7eCY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/ycTcW4YJmD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/ZVSVeG9W5w1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:03.546Z"}